{
  "shots": [
    {
      "sentence": "My grandfather always warned me never to acknowledge the man sitting in the corner of the station after midnight.",
      "search_term": "old man whispering",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "An old man whispering to a young man in a dimly lit room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_1.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.802,
      "start": 0.151,
      "end": 4.953
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I laughed it off for months, keeping my eyes glued to the security monitors while the rhythmic hum of the servers filled the room.",
      "search_term": "security guard monitors",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A security guard watching multiple glowing monitors in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_2.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.863,
      "start": 5.434,
      "end": 11.297
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Tonight, the flickering fluorescent light finally burned out, plunging the back corner into absolute darkness.",
      "search_term": "flickering light bulb",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A flickering office light bulb going out completely.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_3.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.382,
      "start": 11.677,
      "end": 17.059
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I reached for my flashlight, but my hand froze when I heard the distinct sound of heavy breathing coming from the shadows.",
      "search_term": "person holding flashlight",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person holding a flashlight in a dark room with a nervous expression.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.362,
      "start": 17.58,
      "end": 22.942
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I told myself it was just the ventilation system, but the sound was rhythmic, deliberate, and far too close.",
      "search_term": "scared person listening",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Close up of a person looking anxious and listening intently.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.822,
      "start": 23.403,
      "end": 28.225
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Slowly, I turned my chair, the metal legs scraping against the concrete floor like a jagged blade.",
      "search_term": "spinning office chair",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "An office chair spinning slowly in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.104,
      "start": 28.765,
      "end": 33.869
    },
    {
      "sentence": "A pale, thin finger emerged from the dark, pointing directly at the computer screen I had been watching all night.",
      "search_term": "pale hand shadows",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A pale, bony hand reaching out from deep shadows.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.684,
      "start": 34.289,
      "end": 39.973
    },
    {
      "sentence": "My heart hammered against my ribs as I looked at the monitor, half-expecting to see a ghost or a glitch.",
      "search_term": "terrified eyes reflection",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Close up of a person's wide, terrified eyes reflecting a screen.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.083,
      "start": 40.373,
      "end": 45.456
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Instead, I saw a live feed of my own living room, recorded three hours ago.",
      "search_term": "cctv living room",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A grainy security camera view of a dark living room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_9.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.842,
      "start": 45.917,
      "end": 49.759
    },
    {
      "sentence": "In the video, I was sleeping soundly on my couch, oblivious to the tall, gaunt figure standing directly over me.",
      "search_term": "person sleeping couch",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person sleeping on a couch with a dark silhouette standing behind them.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_10.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 6.104,
      "start": 50.199,
      "end": 56.303
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I looked back at the corner, my voice trembling as I whispered for the stranger to leave.",
      "search_term": "man looking corner",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A man looking into a dark, empty corner of a room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_11.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.143,
      "start": 56.743,
      "end": 60.886
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The figure stepped into the sliver of moonlight, revealing a face that looked exactly like my own, only decades older and rotted.",
      "search_term": "old man face",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A close up of a weathered, aged face emerging from shadows.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_12.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 6.544,
      "start": 61.286,
      "end": 67.83
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It leaned forward, its breath smelling of stagnant soil and damp earth.",
      "search_term": "dark silhouette leaning",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, blurred silhouette leaning toward the camera lens.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_13.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.585,
      "start": 68.23,
      "end": 71.815
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It didn't attack me or scream, it simply tapped its watch and pointed to the door.",
      "search_term": "hand pointing door",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A hand pointing toward an exit door.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_14.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.646,
      "start": 72.256,
      "end": 75.902
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The clock on the wall struck one, and suddenly, the station lights flared back to life.",
      "search_term": "bright lights turning on",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Bright fluorescent lights flickering on in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_15.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.367,
      "start": 76.282,
      "end": 80.649
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The corner was empty, but my phone buzzed with a new notification.",
      "search_term": "phone notification dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A smartphone screen lighting up with a notification in the dark.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_16.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.225,
      "start": 81.09,
      "end": 84.315
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It was a text from my wife, sent while I was sitting here.",
      "search_term": "reading text message",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Close up of a person reading a text message on a phone.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_17.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.785,
      "start": 84.715,
      "end": 87.5
    },
    {
      "sentence": "She asked why I had just walked through the front door and crawled into bed without saying a word.",
      "search_term": "empty bedroom night",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, empty bedroom with a bed visible in the moonlight.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_18.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.765,
      "start": 87.941,
      "end": 91.706
    }
